<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/8-50.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Anfaal 8:50 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kuma dã kã gani, a lõkacin da Malã&#x27;iku suke karɓar rãyukan waɗanda suka kãfirta, sunã dukar fuskõkinsu da ɗuwãwunsu, kuma suna cẽwa: &quot;Ku ɗanɗani azãbar Gõb\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/8.html\">Sura Al-Anfaal</a> › Aya 50</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Anfaal 8:50</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَوْ تَرَىٰ إِذْ يَتَوَفَّى الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا الْمَلَائِكَةُ يَضْرِبُونَ وُجُوهَهُمْ وَأَدْبَارَهُمْ وَذُوقُوا عَذَابَ الْحَرِيقِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma dã kã gani, a lõkacin da Malã&#x27;iku suke karɓar rãyukan waɗanda suka kãfirta, sunã dukar fuskõkinsu da ɗuwãwunsu, kuma suna cẽwa: &quot;Ku ɗanɗani azãbar Gõbara.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقال تعالى في الأنفال: {ولو ترى إذ يتوفى الذين كفروا الملائكة يضربون وجوههم وأدبارهم وذوقوا عذاب الحريق} {ذلك بما قدمت أيديكم وأن الله ليس بظلام للعبيد} وهذا ذوق له بعد الموت.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 4/267</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي لو ترى ذلك الوقت وما فيه<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/3</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ومثل هذا حذفه من أحسن الكلام لأن المراد أنك لو رأيت ذلك لرأيت هولا عظيما فليس في ذكر الجواب زيادة على ما دل عليه الشرط<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/2</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s8a50\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/8-49.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (8:49)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/8-52.html\">Aya ta gaba (8:52)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/8-52.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Anfaal 8:52 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"&quot;Kamar al&#x27;ãdar mutãnen Fir&#x27;auna da waɗanda suke gabãninsu, sun kãfirta da ãyõyin Allah, sai Allah Ya kãma su da zunubansu. Lalle Allah ne Mai ƙarfi, Mai ts\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/8-52.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Anfaal 8:52 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&quot;Kamar al&#x27;ãdar mutãnen Fir&#x27;auna da waɗanda suke gabãninsu, sun kãfirta da ãyõyin Allah, sai Allah Ya kãma su da zunubansu. Lalle Allah ne Mai ƙarfi, Mai ts\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/8.html\">Sura Al-Anfaal</a> › Aya 52</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Anfaal 8:52</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿كَدَأْبِ آلِ فِرْعَوْنَ وَالَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ كَفَرُوا بِآيَاتِ اللَّهِ فَأَخَذَهُمُ اللَّهُ بِذُنُوبِهِمْ إِنَّ اللَّهَ قَوِيٌّ شَدِيدُ الْعِقَابِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">&quot;Kamar al&#x27;ãdar mutãnen Fir&#x27;auna da waɗanda suke gabãninsu, sun kãfirta da ãyõyin Allah, sai Allah Ya kãma su da zunubansu. Lalle Allah ne Mai ƙarfi, Mai tsananin uƙũba.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن أخذه يتضمن أخذهم ليصلوا بعد الموت إلى العذاب ولفظ الهلاك يقتضي هلاكهم في الدنيا وزوال النعمة عنهم فذكر هلاكهم بزوال النعم وذكروا أخذهم بالنقم<cite>«رسالة في معنى كون الرب عادلا» 1/135</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s8a52\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/8-50.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (8:50)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/8-53.html\">Aya ta gaba (8:53)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/8-53.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Anfaal 8:53 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"&quot;Wancan ne, dõmin lalle ne, Allah bai kasance Mai canza wata ni&#x27;ima wadda ya ni&#x27;imtar da ita a kan wasu mutãne ba fãce sun sãke abin da yake ga rãyukansu, \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/8-53.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Anfaal 8:53 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&quot;Wancan ne, dõmin lalle ne, Allah bai kasance Mai canza wata ni&#x27;ima wadda ya ni&#x27;imtar da ita a kan wasu mutãne ba fãce sun sãke abin da yake ga rãyukansu, \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/8.html\">Sura Al-Anfaal</a> › Aya 53</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Anfaal 8:53</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّ اللَّهَ لَمْ يَكُ مُغَيِّرًا نِّعْمَةً أَنْعَمَهَا عَلَىٰ قَوْمٍ حَتَّىٰ يُغَيِّرُوا مَا بِأَنفُسِهِمْ وَأَنَّ اللَّهَ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">&quot;Wancan ne, dõmin lalle ne, Allah bai kasance Mai canza wata ni&#x27;ima wadda ya ni&#x27;imtar da ita a kan wasu mutãne ba fãce sun sãke abin da yake ga rãyukansu, kuma dõmin lalle Allah ne Mai jĩ, Masani.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلا يسلبهم إلا إذا غيروا ما في أنفسهم بالمعاصي والذنوب فلا يجزى بالسيئات إلا من فعل السيئات ولا يوقع النقم ويسلب النعم إلا من أتى بالسيئات المقتضية لذلك<cite>«رسالة في معنى كون الرب عادلا» 1/134</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وكذلك إذا أنعم عليك ثم سلبك النعمة فإنه لم يسلبها لبخل منه ولا استئثار بها عليك وإنما أنت المسبب فى سلبها عنك،<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/64</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s8a53\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/8-52.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (8:52)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/8-54.html\">Aya ta gaba (8:54)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/8-54.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Anfaal 8:54 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kamar al&#x27;adar mutãnen Fir&#x27;auna da waɗanda suke a gabãninsu, sun ƙaryata game da ãyõyin Ubangijinsu, sai Muka halaka su, sabõda zunubansu, kuma Muka nutsar \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/8-54.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/8-54.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/8-54.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/8-54.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/8-54.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/8-54.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hre